        <item>
            <title>1.1.0</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
  <li>When an MCP app wants to send, Allow sends that one email, and its menu offers Allow for 1 Hour or Allow All</li>
  <li>Allow All stops asking for that app, and you can turn asking back on anytime in MCP settings</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
