            <title>1.0.9</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
  <li>Move to Junk is now Report Spam, and Mailfan calls the folder Spam, so it's clear your mail provider learns from it</li>
  <li>Your reply shows up in the open conversation right after you send it, and new replies appear without reopening the conversation</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
