            <title>1.0.8</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
  <li>Mailfan reconnects by itself after your Mac wakes or the network changes, so mail keeps syncing</li>
  <li>When an MCP app wants to send, Send All for 1 Hour lets that app send without asking for the next hour</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
