        <item>
            <title>1.0.1</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
  <li>Meeting invites show as a card with Add to Calendar</li>
  <li>Run Mailfan actions from Shortcuts</li>
  <li>Recipients are suggested from your Contacts as you type</li>
  <li>Quoted text in replies tucks away behind Show Quotes</li>
  <li>Links in mail open without tracking parameters</li>
  <li>Sign-in emails get an Open Link button</li>
  <li>See the sender's domain at a glance, open their website from the header, and copy their name or email</li>
  <li>Mailfan tells you when your server marked a message as spam, and Not Junk moves it back</li>
  <li>Moving mail to Junk now teaches your server's spam filter too</li>
  <li>Conversations follow your server's own threads on IMAP and JMAP</li>
  <li>Trusted MCP tokens can send email without asking each time</li>
  <li>Account settings in clear sections, with account and tag colors picked from a popover</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
