        <item>
            <title>1.0.0</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
  <li>Every account in one calm inbox: Gmail, Outlook, iCloud, Yahoo, Fastmail and any IMAP, POP3 or JMAP server</li>
  <li>Triage from the keyboard with archive, snooze, pin, Reply Later, undo send and a command palette</li>
  <li>Inbox split into People, Updates and Newsletters, plus rules, templates and send later</li>
  <li>AI summaries, reply drafts and Ask your inbox with Apple Intelligence, Ollama, LM Studio or your own key</li>
  <li>Claude, Cursor and other agents can search and draft mail through MCP, with tokens you scope</li>
  <li>Your mail stays on your Mac</li>
  <li>Try everything free for 14 days, then keep it with a one-time license</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
